{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"sfc07235a1e145ae8","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-b7be720829103ee96344","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"sfc07235a1e145ae8","text":"나야, 이렇게 소리 소문 없이 나타나서 놀랐지?","speaker":"달리아","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"달구리아","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["6056509939896236547"],"speakerHashCandidates":["16283352174817039417","5321979354536644671","13106621741979659453","8337291419615972675","13571625135367686030","12086759437005000686","3124734747710142060","17887375822068359908","14546471227447030101"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-0cc05f650a0add52172d","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"sfc07235a1e145ae8","text":"놀랍기도 하고, 의외이기도 해요","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"달구리아","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["3048245970744091854"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-ee53574e20d8aa237b5c","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"sfc07235a1e145ae8","text":"달리아 씨의… 코스어신가요?","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"달구리아","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["17229251570581834692"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-d9d2b342f713869113a7","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"sfc07235a1e145ae8","text":"하지만 잊힌 것들에도 온도가 있어. 마치 무도회가 끝난 뒤 맞닿았던 이마에 오래도록 남아있는 온기처럼… 아! 얼굴이 빨개졌네. 너무 가까이 다가갔나구리?","speaker":"달리아","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"달구리아","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["5751018598790123027"],"speakerHashCandidates":["16283352174817039417","5321979354536644671","13106621741979659453","8337291419615972675","13571625135367686030","12086759437005000686","3124734747710142060","17887375822068359908","14546471227447030101"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-5caeb530572bf71667a9","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"sfc07235a1e145ae8","text":"적어도 지금만큼은 내 시야에서 벗어나지 마구리. 우리의 이 「추억」을 멋대로 떨쳐내지 말아 줘……","speaker":"달리아","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"달구리아","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16139613334032787464"],"speakerHashCandidates":["16283352174817039417","5321979354536644671","13106621741979659453","8337291419615972675","13571625135367686030","12086759437005000686","3124734747710142060","17887375822068359908","14546471227447030101"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-26ea38a6e1e54807e862","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"sfc07235a1e145ae8","text":"유감이지만 이미 간파했어","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"달구리아","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["8815663982486129837"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-46b2258acfd9081fa235","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"sfc07235a1e145ae8","text":"너구리 말투가 널 배신했거든!","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"달구리아","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["1214350610530789630","13284515834642812686"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-0bb8e9c8f3c66509dbb4","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"sfc07235a1e145ae8","text":"뭐, 뭐라고? 간파했다고?","speaker":"달구리아","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"달구리아","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16908293200640384266"],"speakerHashCandidates":["4520963738368798420"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-e608bd90f6e6f032e581","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"sfc07235a1e145ae8","text":"아직도 달리아 씨 대사를 외우는 거야?","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"달구리아","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["10535322887449430678"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-173cf70489bfdd0b1849","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"sfc07235a1e145ae8","text":"나를 뼛속 깊이 새겨줘!","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"달구리아","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["9247288531952083042"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-31b61f94509191e29868","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"sfc07235a1e145ae8","text":"아야, 살살 좀 해!","speaker":"달구리아","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"달구리아","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["3605858196477048794"],"speakerHashCandidates":["4520963738368798420"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-5c770d6d685eacc5508e","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"sfc07235a1e145ae8","text":"전투 승리","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"달구리아","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["8723470052033051410","7403240024892754575","11772016648525791211","10013471783448067149","7935611339539521347","2767476951280224134","17230053657365654391","13219880830931695292","8235589048869356967","15783251403196359244","4046609884937590054","14374415701424284075","4523508968755439876","11377936690954911852","17119884998212637105","13287632236437638289","5288277152883538574","17779838753991374431","7114992652870845150","16249195042267228396","8931076324431767509","1233240243888193610","16943935910483475293","4111289784445118070","1668886458587638950","18059620588043462567","7925972894534668377","4279073245154188926","17073903812568708459","11731902046549886525","13994048770473222556","3933970863752741239","8305072914960917401","17495965874865904298","2483269264799096004","14642515349609363003","287093083579486017","18253601320750678779","1819968082699617436","9483561357984775124","18068433741811164055","1553447527565262035","4591284820386333403","12065213485840793523","15492914675732314627","3400181585670243951","14233311959226850754","7361436329569926038","8812315363318998702","11376674803156187347","10772273872375731704","10516684828278107707","303792755391556370","7654181513509767357","5549306162418962199","15598240444259308527","3900550998959882177","942944660554485824","2336002649284474892","7785680765539925545","17424851610859437129","6014244792137195572","630455236554648569","10571412933391534689","5680847160178757077","12974373846833495761","16749625676916946495","15195054422155801301","18167647477667835355","51229290360474101","13214382975703949193","4203195876423092370","8809847310485469524","11991541663670961103","18010304010806707040","8943552587960275709","1064144463524178309","1370212714949631723","12265115158130789715","14319714245362157296","12936391475062931111","10018206328210592173","8532580617364287157","6707279602816279145","18399567488449084815","5944608665828895279","13016346440978669659","17370638107535000196","9509430450757876488","256503646938432741"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-833453b75a7f1ae06b19","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"sfc07235a1e145ae8","text":"죽음의 순간은… 정말 아름다워. 아아아, 안타깝게도 지금 죽는 게 바로 나, 「달구리아」라니!","speaker":"달구리아","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"달구리아","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["6169648387574969343"],"speakerHashCandidates":["4520963738368798420"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-d704e78453bf26f02cf0","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"sfc07235a1e145ae8","text":"사람들은 날 알아보고, 친근하게 「선생님」이라고 부르며 날 인파 한가운데로 모셔!","speaker":"달구리아","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"달구리아","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["2850614166848699217"],"speakerHashCandidates":["4520963738368798420"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-ea453758c42302480b26","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"sfc07235a1e145ae8","text":"돌아가서 일이나 해!","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"달구리아","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["10415873877616592570"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-bf28e5288b963ce54107","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"sfc07235a1e145ae8","text":"아아아, 사장님이 코스튬 플레이를 못 하게 하는 이유를 알겠어. 아직… 근무 시간이기 때문이구나!","speaker":"달구리아","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"달구리아","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["530427433559156666"],"speakerHashCandidates":["4520963738368798420"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-71d87f6751ffa184e976","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"sfc07235a1e145ae8","text":"그냥 스타레일 FES에서 연기자나 해!","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"달구리아","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["4624868404085360420"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-d98f73e051b02f491f6b","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"sfc07235a1e145ae8","text":"아아아, 사장님도… 내 완벽 재현 코스튬 플레이에 반한 건가? 역시 내 너구리 변신술은 완벽해. 사장님 말고는 아무도 간파할 수 없지!","speaker":"달구리아","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"달구리아","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["17177531612135567083"],"speakerHashCandidates":["4520963738368798420"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-b94d653ab1e04bf9f231","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"sfc07235a1e145ae8","text":"사장님, 그럼 즐겁게 관람해! 난 좀 돌아다니면서 다음 전시 포인트를 체크할게","speaker":"달구리아","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"달구리아","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["9350573586182627880"],"speakerHashCandidates":["4520963738368798420"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"interaction-p38150","title":"변신의 달인 너구리","page":"百变狸猫","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-b7be720829103ee96344","rowId":"other-interaction-p38150-b7be720829103ee96344","missionId":"interaction-p38150","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","sceneId":"sfc07235a1e145ae8","scene":"달구리아","contextId":"wiki-context-d31b2ff53ddfedbb83d995d4","page":"百变狸猫","revision":97705,"location":[0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":["other-interaction-p38150-0cc05f650a0add52172d","other-interaction-p38150-ee53574e20d8aa237b5c"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-0cc05f650a0add52172d","rowId":"other-inter